    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201600611/2016006110020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうか、好きなものは\r\n最後まで取っておくんだな",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2016006110030,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "はい\r\nなので、仕事の後のケーキは至福です～……",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201600611/2016006110030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは\r\nそれならよかった",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "俺は、至福……と同時に\r\nこの時間の糖分に若干の罪悪感が……",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2016006110040,
